{"game": "roboquest", "language": "english", "appid": 692890, "month": "2024-11", "window": 1, "start_date": 1730419200, "end_date": 1731023999, "month_true_total": 327, "quota": 6, "returned": 6, "pulled_at": "2026-10-03 01:54:22 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "178585178", "author": {"steamid": "76561198287018578", "personaname": "SupremeFsh", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198287018578/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 4433, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2820, "last_played": 1778975158, "avatar": "712fd3668e374c3c4ad59af9e1dc5707bf2e93aa"}, "language": "english", "review": "Best FPS game ever no contest, Valorant doesn't hold a candle to this. If you disagree come fight me, I'll personally beat some sense into yo ass.", "timestamp_created": 1731018343, "timestamp_updated": 1731018343, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.493403702974319458", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 5, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "178585035", "author": {"steamid": "76561198253043075", "personaname": "Pokemon Sapphire", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198253043075/", "num_games_owned": 1094, "num_reviews": 193, "playtime_forever": 1149, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1149, "last_played": 1705632192, "avatar": "c6ac8eef0e2faaa60daac2723b971ba3aba179e4"}, "language": "english", "review": "Happy 8 years for the game made by my frend Robonos the bear.", "timestamp_created": 1731018143, "timestamp_updated": 1731018143, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.511111080646514893", "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "178580334", "author": {"steamid": "76561199384279719", "personaname": "Xplosion", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199384279719/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 3241, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1160, "last_played": 1737258131, "avatar": "182bbc0424106c8a5ff3d800a3b2b0899c327ddb"}, "language": "english", "review": "The perfect cross of Borderland/Doom FPS with a 10/10 awesome soundtrack. I feel terrible for getting this on sell because I would pay full price for this game.", "timestamp_created": 1731011939, "timestamp_updated": 1731213826, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "178577847", "author": {"steamid": "76561198120035107", "personaname": "DryMotion", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/DryMotion/", "num_games_owned": 388, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 5393, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5388, "last_played": 1759520210, "avatar": "cdff433c9ea96c9933449fa59011b1dc31a4f0a2"}, "language": "english", "review": "Best first person roguelike experience out there with tons of free updates and support by the devs. Truly an underrated masterpiece", "timestamp_created": 1731008885, "timestamp_updated": 1731008885, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "178568394", "author": {"steamid": "76561198060590141", "personaname": "Kallen Kozuki", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/DarkAngelofFire/", "num_games_owned": 495, "num_reviews": 13, "playtime_forever": 4586, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 742, "last_played": 1784660650, "avatar": "bac2b7246109cc2e384d38610e7d107a92575658"}, "language": "english", "review": "In short: this game is a certified banger.\n\nLong: If you wanted a game that plays like modern DOOM, has the style and gun RNG of Borderlands, and the Roguelike of Risk of Rain 2, it's kind of a perfect package. Runs never feel too long, the upgrades you get at base help but don't make you overpowered, the characters feel fun to play as, and there's obtuse unlocks that make you feel good for even finding a piece of the puzzle.\n\nThe story is there, but doesn't intrude. You can choose to ignore it but it's fun, though not super deep.\n\nThe character classes are where the game shines in addition to the perk system. I don't know if it was intended but the classes almost seem to be consolidations of various shooter archetypes. Boomer Shooter Revival, movement shooter, Engineer, stealth sniper. Yet you can almost play them however you want be it super aggro or pulled back or slow. The game doesn't feel like one bot is better than the other, more like you're encouraged to just try new builds and see what you can do with them.\n\nI got it on sale but buy it ASAP, it slaps and it deserves support. Also the sountrack beats the tar out of you, it's so good.", "timestamp_created": 1730998094, "timestamp_updated": 1730998094, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "178565595", "author": {"steamid": "76561198053892511", "personaname": "KingKowalski", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/kingkowalski/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 22, "playtime_forever": 3056, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1755, "last_played": 1749500273, "avatar": "2ae0c5752c19a5dbe37dbd9909c107bdf73c8709"}, "language": "english", "review": "Perfect!", "timestamp_created": 1730994837, "timestamp_updated": 1730994837, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}]}